An oneiroscope lets its user look into dreams. The experimental one the oneiromancer [[People/Althane/Aliaksandr Sarken|Aliaksandr Sarken]] left behind when he fled Salores lets its users enter them. [[Org/Althane/The Weft|The Weft]] found it in his hideout and used it to go into the cognitive interior of a [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] orb, where they met [[People/Althane/Halidex Op-B|Hali]] and [[People/Althane/Tennobrin Er-K|Tenno]].
